#: data/maps/Route113/scripts.inc:136
msgctxt "Route113_Text_AshCanBeFashionedIntoGlass"
msgid ""
"Wahahaha! Today's technology is a\n"
"wondrous thing!\p"
"Take this volcanic ash here.\n"
"It can be fashioned into glass.$"
msgstr ""
"哇哈哈哈！现在的技术真是太神奇了！\p"
"就拿这里的火山灰来说吧，\n"
"它可以做成玻璃哦。$"

#: data/maps/Route113/scripts.inc:142
msgctxt "Route113_Text_FunWalkingThroughAsh"
msgid ""
"It's fun walking through the volcano's\n"
"ashes on the ground and grass.\p"
"You can see where you walked--it's\n"
"really neat!$"
msgstr ""
"在地面和草丛里的火山灰上走路很好玩。\p"
"可以看到自己走过的\n"
"痕迹——真的很有意思！$"

