#: data/maps/Route113/scripts.inc:156
msgctxt "Route113_Text_TrainerTipsRegisterKeyItems"
msgid ""
"TRAINER TIPS\p"
"You may register one of the KEY ITEMS\n"
"in your BAG as SELECT.\p"
"Simply press SELECT to use\n"
"the registered item conveniently.$"
msgstr ""
"训练家小知识\p"
"可以把包包里的\n"
"一件重要物品登记到SELECT键上。\p"
"只要按下SELECT键，\n"
"就能方便地使用登记的道具。$"

